und-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e]\u0026nbsp;Etiquette\u0026nbsp;Kit\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e] Accessibility\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003e] Sufficient Recourses \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#333333\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(84, 84, 84); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e✘\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003e] Lag Free\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eTips:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003eThere is some detail and detail isn't really the main feature of this map, its all the layers, platforms and much more. I think it would be best to have something around the border of the iron blocks similar to the border around the a....\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003ecolor\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;bridge.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"\u003eJudging with the images provided I am really interested by this style of gameplay although I will say, it's more likely you're going to get knocked off then actually have a general gist of pvp. I suggest increase the sizes of platforms or actually have a larger center.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003eIndeed the accessibility is a tick but that is a lot of\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003eaccessibility\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;and also encourages Spawn killing since there's an easy way there and a almost impossible path to the monument there is a\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003eDelmar with multiple users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;I think it would be nice to have another large island behind the White, Yellow, Blue and white platforms to make it less hard to reach the monument.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px;\"\u003eAvicus won't be using YAML for much longer so please consider converting your YAML to XML.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePLEASE NOTE: !! Your map may not get a response from a Map Dev for the next few months as for in the most recent post they aren't really looking for any more DTM Maps! So don't get mad if they don't respond!\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 14.98px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eYou may find \u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/90c7b1260\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ethis threa\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/90c7b1260\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ed\u003c/a\u003e useful for what maps are needed.\u003c/i\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eConclusion:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eThe map with an interesting twist and very unique style of gameplay, definitely isn't a map we've seen before. With a few more edits\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003estated above\u003c/i\u003e this map could get a higher chance of being accepted!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eRegards,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"\u003eTiger\u003c/span\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1468358477},{"id":317633,"author":"InputIGNHere","body":"I have added a GitHub link to all the files as I need help with the YML and XML. Also, if you have made any changes to the YML and XML please add your name to the Contributors list on the README. Github -\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/jasoryeh/SACDTM/tree/master\"\u003ehttps://github.com/jasoryeh/SACDTM/tree/master\u003c/a\u003e","body_tagged":"I have added a GitHub link to all the files as I need help with the YML and XML. Also, if you have made any changes to the YML and XML please add your name to the Contributors list on the README. Github -\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/jasoryeh/SACDTM/tree/master\"\u003ehttps://github.com/jasoryeh/SACDTM/tree/master\u003c/a\u003e","created_at":1468370196},{"id":317634,"author":"InputIGNHere","body":"Thanks, for the suggestions Tiger! I'll try and get in a XML file when I can. But Avicus needs a XML tutorial... I'm stuck at region setting... got me confused. As for the map suggestions I'll try to add some detail in when I can.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Input\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"Thanks, for the suggestions Tiger! I'll try and get in a XML file when I can. But Avicus needs a XML tutorial... I'm stuck at region setting... got me confused. As for the map suggestions I'll try to add some detail in when I can.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Input\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1468370668,"reply_to":317605},{"id":317666,"author":"Xuph","body":"\u003ca href=\"http://www.atlas.avicus.net\" title=\"Link: http://www.atlas.avicus.net\"\u003eatlas.avicus.net\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;docs for xml, if you need any help or struggle with that contact me on my skype: eric_mcgamer or any other mapdev, their skype is usually on their profile.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eas for the map, the islands are extremely small and the gameplay will all be based on bridging, which is usually not a good thing. widen the islands a lot especially that little mid-side islands, and make elevations. also add a bit of room for tunneling id suggest\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eedit: room for tunneling only in certain islands the side ones are ok","body_tagged":"\u003ca href=\"http://www.atlas.avicus.net\" title=\"Link: http://www.atlas.avicus.net\"\u003eatlas.avicus.net\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;docs for xml, if you need any help or struggle with that contact me on my skype: eric_mcgamer or any other mapdev, their skype is usually on their profile.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eas for the map, the islands are extremely small and the gameplay will all be based on bridging, which is usually not a good thing. widen the islands a lot especially that little mid-side islands, and make elevations. also add a bit of room for tunneling id suggest\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eedit: room for tunneling only in certain islands the side ones are ok","created_at":1468391238,"reply_to":317634},{"id":350710,"author":"InputIGNHere","body":"\u003cb\u003eSpaceships and Colors has been updated to 2.0, however the maps may have not been updated on the GitHub, the files will be uploaded, and updated soon for S\u0026amp;C 2.0.\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003eSpaceships and Colors has been updated to 2.0, however the maps may have not been updated on the GitHub, the files will be uploaded, and updated soon for S\u0026amp;C 2.0.\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1483393002},{"id":351469,"author":"InputIGNHere","body":"What do you guys think? Suggestions?","body_tagged":"What do you guys think? Suggestions?","created_at":1483657234},{"id":351495,"author":"Limidi","body":"I really like the pictures. Looks like a fun map to play on! A bit, bright. too many colors. but I really like the idea.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOverall: I like the idea and I hope this gets added, but it is a little to bright.","body_tagged":"I really like the pictures. Looks like a fun map to play on! A bit, bright. too many colors. but I really like the idea.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOverall: I like the idea and I hope this gets added, but it is a little to bright.","created_at":1483667219},{"id":351512,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"I really like it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: You might want to add more elevation.","body_tagged":"I really like it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: You might want to add more elevation.","created_at":1483672534},{"id":351562,"author":"cellish","body":"More detail? Looks simple\u003cbr\u003eanyways +1","body_tagged":"More detail? Looks simple\u003cbr\u003eanyways +1","created_at":1483705405},{"id"